  clear hX0 hX1 hX2 hX3 hX4 hX5 hX6 hX7 hX8 hX9 hX10 hX11 hX12 hX13 hX14 hX15
  refine ⟨r40, h40, hr40, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩
